<title>UK: IADB sets 1.5 bln Czech crown one-year bond.</title>
<headline>IADB sets 1.5 bln Czech crown one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTER-AMERICAN DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN CZK   COUPON     11.0	MATURITY    15.JAN.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.73    PAY DATE    15.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    99.88     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 25	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.85	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
